5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that covers costs without creating unnecessary barriers for new members. I suggest we look at the actual usage and the financial history first.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, Asuka. I believe we should also consider the administrative burden placed on the treasurer; it would be a shame to bankrupt the person in time and effort.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It might be helpful to see who is actually utilizing the club's resources and who is contributing to the operational side of things.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get too sentimental about ""effort."" We need hard data on why people are hesitating to show up. I'll be looking for the gaps in attendance.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm tired of guessing. We can't just pick a number and hope for the best like last time. We need to know exactly what's coming in and what's going out.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, while the ledger is essential, we must be careful not to make the fee structure so rigid that it alienates those who are just starting to integrate.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A balance between financial solvency and human sustainability is the goal. I'm curious if the workload is as daunting as the rumors suggest.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps we can find a middle ground if we understand the distribution of activity. It would be unfair to ignore the disparity in usage.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, ""disparity"" is a polite word for it. Some people treat this club like a hotel they only visit when the weather is perfect.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""feelings"" or ""hotels"" right now. If we don't have a clear picture of the bank balance and renewals, we're just flying blind.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall leave you all to your passions. I will focus on the logistics of the role and the actual expenditures.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the attendance records and the rota. I think it's important to know who is carrying the weight.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the sign-in sheets and the weekday turnout. I want to see exactly when the enthusiasm started to dip.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Fine. I'm going for the bank statements and the ledger. I'm not letting us guess the budget again.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms. We need to understand the perspective of those who don't yet belong.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
